        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/f6c823/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-28T23:55:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So looking through the starter kit scenario, I noticed that the T-Rex has a bonus to Overcome checks.</p>\n<p>But then I started thinking about it, and realized that either I am missing something or else the T-Rex has no reason to ever use an Overcome action!</p>\n<p>In fact, outside of specialized things like Baron Blade reactivating his systems, there seems to be no reason for *any* NPC to Overcome.&nbsp; Am I missing something?&nbsp; Thanks!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:37.408Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
