        "raw": "<p>So looking through the starter kit scenario, I noticed that the T-Rex has a bonus to Overcome checks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But then I started thinking about it, and realized that either I am missing something or else the T-Rex has no reason to ever use an Overcome action!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In fact, outside of specialized things like Baron Blade reactivating his systems, there seems to be no reason for *any* NPC to Overcome.&nbsp; Am I missing something?&nbsp; Thanks!</p>",
